msgstr "Bazaar je otvorený. Keď skončíte s prezeraním, zatvorte ho."

msgid "Bazaar, the app store (Flathub)"
msgstr "Bazaar, obchod s aplikáciami (Flathub)"

msgid ""
"Before you unplug it, click the eject button next to its name, and wait until"
