msgstr "Intel (staršie čipy): blikanie alebo zamŕzanie"

msgid "Internet and networks"
msgstr "Internet a siete"

msgid "It adds its maker's download source, so it updates with System Update."
msgstr ""
"Pridá zdroj na stiahnutie od svojho výrobcu, takže sa aktualizuje nástrojom "
"Aktualizácia systému."

msgid ""
"It also has a device rule. That goes on the system, so you will be asked for "
"your password."
msgstr ""
"Má aj pravidlo pre zariadenie. To sa pridáva do systému, takže budete vyzvaní"
" na zadanie hesla."

msgid "It comes back on by itself on a Home network."
msgstr "V sieti Domov sa samo znova zapne."

msgid "It could not reach the internet. Check the connection, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Nepodarilo sa pripojiť na internet. Skontrolujte pripojenie a potom to skúste"
" znova."

msgid "It didn't work, and nothing was changed."
msgstr "Nefungovalo to a nič sa nezmenilo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It didn't work, and nothing was changed.\n"
"\n"
"The details are in {log}"
msgstr ""
"Nefungovalo to a nič sa nezmenilo.\n"
"\n"
"Podrobnosti nájdete v {log}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It didn't work, and nothing was changed. Try again later.\n"
"\n"
"The details are in {log}"
msgstr ""
"Nefungovalo to a nič sa nezmenilo. Skúste to znova neskôr.\n"
"\n"
"Podrobnosti nájdete v {log}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It didn't work.\n"
"\n"
"The details are in {log}"
msgstr ""
"Nefungovalo to.\n"
"\n"
"Podrobnosti nájdete v {log}"

msgid ""
"It gives anyone at the keyboard a shell with full control, with no password."
msgstr ""
"Každému, kto sedí za klávesnicou, to dá prístup do príkazového riadku s plnou"
" kontrolou a bez hesla."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "It goes in the {label} and updates with System Update."
msgstr ""
"Umiestni sa sem: {label}. Aktualizuje sa nástrojom Aktualizácia systému."

msgid "It has no app of its own; other apps in the box use it."
msgstr "Nemá vlastnú aplikáciu; používajú ho iné aplikácie v kontajneri."

msgid "It has no window of its own in Show Apps."
msgstr "V ponuke Zobrazí aplikácie nemá vlastné okno."

msgid "It is a command-line tool, so it has no window in Show Apps."
msgstr ""
"Je to nástroj príkazového riadka, takže v ponuke Zobrazí aplikácie nemá okno."

msgid "It is made for a different kind of processor than this computer has."
msgstr "Je určené pre iný typ procesora, než aký má tento počítač."

msgid ""
"It may not work yet. When it does, it works in Firefox and the Camera app, "
"not every app."
msgstr ""
"Možno to ešte nefunguje. Keď to funguje, funguje to vo Firefoxe a v aplikácii"
" Kamera, nie v každej aplikácii."

msgid ""
"It needs parts that the Ubuntu box (Ubuntu 24.04) does not have. It may be "
"made for a newer or older Ubuntu."
msgstr ""
"Potrebuje súčasti, ktoré kontajner Ubuntu (Ubuntu 24.04) nemá. Možno je "
"určený pre novšiu alebo staršiu verziu Ubuntu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It needs {name}, which Fedora {version} does not have. It may be made for a "
"different Fedora version."
msgstr ""
"Potrebuje {name}, čo Fedora {version} nemá. Môže byť určené pre inú verziu "
"Fedory."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It needs {name}, which the Ubuntu box (Ubuntu 24.04) does not have. It may be"
" made for a newer or older Ubuntu."
msgstr ""
"Potrebuje {name}, čo kontajner Ubuntu (Ubuntu 24.04) nemá. Možno je určený "
"pre novšiu alebo staršiu verziu Ubuntu."

msgid "It never updates."
msgstr "Nikdy sa neaktualizuje."

msgid ""
"It opens file sharing ports: folders are shared only on Home networks, in "
"Shared folders."
msgstr ""
"Otvára porty na zdieľanie súborov: priečinky sa zdieľajú iba v sieťach Domov,"
" v časti Zdieľané priečinky."

msgid "It says first whether the app keeps itself updated, then installs it."
msgstr ""
"Najprv oznámi, či sa aplikácia sama aktualizuje, a potom ju nainštaluje."

msgid "It starts when you restart the computer."
msgstr "Spustí sa, keď reštartujete počítač."

msgid ""
"It stops a driver from loading. If it's the drive's or the screen's driver, "
"the computer won't start."
msgstr ""
"Zabráni načítaniu ovládača. Ak ide o ovládač disku alebo obrazovky, počítač "
"sa nespustí."

msgid ""
"It tells you whether there's a version for EvenKeelOS, or a replacement that "
"does the same job."
msgstr ""
"Povie vám, či existuje verzia pre EvenKeelOS, alebo náhrada, ktorá robí to "
"isté."

msgid ""
"It turns off SELinux, which keeps apps and services from reaching what they "
"shouldn't."
msgstr ""
"Vypne SELinux, ktorý zabraňuje aplikáciám a službám v prístupe k tomu, ku "
"čomu by nemali mať prístup."

msgid "It turns off or weakens a security protection."
msgstr "Vypne alebo oslabí bezpečnostnú ochranu."

msgid "It turns off protection against processor security flaws."
msgstr "Vypne ochranu proti bezpečnostným chybám procesora."

msgid ""
"It turns off the graphics driver: low resolution, no outside screens, and "
"sleep may not work."
msgstr ""
"Vypne grafický ovládač: nízke rozlíšenie, žiadne externé obrazovky a režim "
"spánku nemusí fungovať."

msgid "It updates by itself."
msgstr "Aktualizuje sa samo."

msgid ""
"It would replace a file that belongs to the system, so it was not added."
msgstr "Nahradilo by to súbor, ktorý patrí systému, takže nebolo pridané."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "It's already set: the version from {date} starts at your next restart."
msgstr "Už je to nastavené: verzia z {date} sa spustí pri ďalšom reštarte."

msgid "It's in Wheelhouse if you want it again."
msgstr "Ak to budete znova chcieť, nájdete to vo Wheelhouse."

msgid "It's on. From your next restart, the disk unlocks by itself."
msgstr "Je to zapnuté. Po ďalšom reštarte sa disk odomkne sám."

msgid ""
"Its file changed or holds more than one certificate, so nothing was removed. "
"Tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Jeho súbor sa zmenil alebo obsahuje viac ako jeden certifikát, takže nič "
"nebolo odstránené. Informujte svojho pomocníka."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Its file is removed, but \"{name}\" is still trusted: it was added somewhere "
"else too. Tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Jeho súbor bol odstránený, ale certifikát „{name}“ je stále dôveryhodný: bol "
"pridaný aj inde. Povedzte to svojmu pomocníkovi."

